WEBVTT

00:10.765 --> 00:11.765
Roaming the street's...

00:12.057 --> 00:13.057
end and lane's edge,

00:13.182 --> 00:14.182
yet never yielding.

00:14.765 --> 00:15.557
Peddling dope...

00:15.765 --> 00:16.432
and drugs,

00:16.765 --> 00:18.085
yet always brotherhood shielding.

00:19.881 --> 00:21.423
After the turmoil,

00:23.518 --> 00:24.518
of killings,

00:25.182 --> 00:26.182
bloodbaths,

00:26.903 --> 00:27.903
loss,

00:28.682 --> 00:29.682
and pain,

00:30.921 --> 00:32.598
Ba in order to protect his friends,

00:32.599 --> 00:34.592
Ba gave his life
in the battle at The North Port.

00:36.200 --> 00:39.277
Hai Cuong ended up in jail,
facing the consequences of his actions.

00:39.682 --> 00:41.349
Using his abilities,

00:41.599 --> 00:44.223
Hao has led Chinatown
to function more expertly each day.

00:44.224 --> 00:46.765
He has created
multiple flourishing front businesses.

00:46.932 --> 00:49.807
Long and Phong have
become his powerful right-hand men.

00:50.390 --> 00:52.350
The security situation
is more unstable than ever.

00:52.557 --> 00:56.956
Hung's leadership in the battle against
crime has intensified at this phase.

00:59.139 --> 01:00.038
That action has had

01:00.063 --> 01:03.326
a direct impact
on the benefits of a covert group,

01:03.811 --> 01:05.811
forcing them to free
the tiger back into the woods.

01:06.111 --> 01:07.653
They are considered to be the Council,

01:07.802 --> 01:09.990
a group that manipulates
the underworld's hierarchy.

01:12.099 --> 01:14.349
Chinatown is more unstable than ever.

01:26.503 --> 01:30.823
BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3

01:32.974 --> 01:33.765
[Episode 3: Fate's Decree]

01:33.890 --> 01:35.557
Open the door for him.

01:43.349 --> 01:44.349
Who are you looking for?

01:47.390 --> 01:48.714
Who is it, Dung?

01:52.057 --> 01:53.057
Hello, mom.

01:53.765 --> 01:54.765
I'm Long's friend.

01:55.265 --> 01:56.465
He invited me here for dinner.

02:00.307 --> 02:01.349
Dung, help me get up.

02:17.202 --> 02:18.202
Here's your water.

02:30.599 --> 02:31.599
You should call Long.

02:32.807 --> 02:34.287
Tell him to
come home soon for dinner.

02:50.411 --> 02:51.411
I'm listening.

02:51.866 --> 02:53.417
Have you invited
anyone to our house?

02:56.710 --> 02:58.794
Tell him that A Din is here.

03:07.932 --> 03:09.099
Do you have shoulder pain?

03:11.324 --> 03:12.849
I used to study a bit...

03:13.640 --> 03:14.765
of traditional medicine.

03:16.265 --> 03:17.557
Let me help you.

03:31.557 --> 03:32.640
Long, is that you?

03:32.849 --> 03:35.515
I'll go to the kitchen
and prepare dinner for you.

03:38.807 --> 03:40.724
Next time, don't come home this late.

03:43.307 --> 03:45.224
Don't let your mom and wife
wait for you.

03:45.599 --> 03:46.599
Dung,

03:46.884 --> 03:48.364
take mom downstairs to get her stuff.

03:48.603 --> 03:49.723
About Chinatown's situation,

03:50.099 --> 03:51.099
if I were you,

03:51.349 --> 03:52.974
I would give it up right away.

03:53.765 --> 03:54.807
A wise man

03:55.057 --> 03:56.599
shapes himself to the circumstances.

03:59.057 --> 04:00.057
Am I right, mom?

04:01.099 --> 04:02.099
Take mom downstairs now.

04:18.640 --> 04:19.946
What have you done to Hao?

04:21.390 --> 04:23.310
I helped him
meet his ancestors a little earlier.

04:23.849 --> 04:24.329
You…

04:24.682 --> 04:26.899
What did you just say?

04:28.682 --> 04:29.946
I killed Hao, mom.

04:30.307 --> 04:31.307
Killed?

04:31.849 --> 04:32.349
You...

04:32.557 --> 04:34.599
Mom?

04:34.600 --> 04:35.724
Mom, open your eyes!

04:37.015 --> 04:37.782
Please open your eyes!

04:37.807 --> 04:38.847
Call an ambulance for her.

04:39.344 --> 04:39.932
Mom?

04:39.933 --> 04:41.466
- Get the old woman to the hospital.
- Mom!

04:41.490 --> 04:42.866
Call an ambulance
to the nearest hospital.

04:42.890 --> 04:44.520
Mom?

05:04.119 --> 05:05.119
How is your mom?

05:07.557 --> 05:08.557
Merely stable now.

05:16.349 --> 05:17.349
Where are you going?

05:23.544 --> 05:24.710
I'm going to talk to Din.

05:27.057 --> 05:28.057
Are you out of your mind?

05:28.724 --> 05:30.364
What the fuck
are you going to talk about?

05:31.460 --> 05:34.387
Be careful or you'll be
the next one on deathbed.

05:34.724 --> 05:35.724
What?

05:37.307 --> 05:38.864
Look what he did to Long's mom.

05:39.307 --> 05:40.765
How could I sit here after that?

05:41.557 --> 05:42.677
Aren't you a police officer?

05:43.557 --> 05:44.557
Why don't you arrest him?

05:44.640 --> 05:45.640
Arrest him?

05:46.890 --> 05:48.250
You really think it's that simple?

05:49.599 --> 05:50.957
Do you want me to arrest him

05:51.390 --> 05:53.426
for going to someone
else's house to peel fruit?

05:54.032 --> 05:54.990
Get some sense, Phong.

05:55.015 --> 05:56.543
If you won't
fucking do it, I will.

05:57.057 --> 05:58.057
Listen.

05:58.130 --> 05:59.676
I will take revenge

06:00.432 --> 06:01.724
more unstable than ever.

06:02.265 --> 06:04.475
Phong, I beg you to
cease causing any trouble, please.

06:06.890 --> 06:08.099
Do you have any plans?

06:10.224 --> 06:11.224
Huh?

06:11.515 --> 06:12.515
Tell me.

06:14.182 --> 06:16.782
After gathering all the brothers,
what are you going to do to him?

06:16.932 --> 06:18.412
Remember that they all have families.

06:19.265 --> 06:21.158
If something were to happen,
nobody would take care of their families.

06:21.182 --> 06:22.182
Can you handle that?

06:28.015 --> 06:29.307
What a bummer.

06:30.099 --> 06:31.099
We are gangsters,

06:31.643 --> 06:32.843
not philosophers.

06:33.327 --> 06:34.428
What is your plan, then?

07:34.182 --> 07:35.474
[Transfer Contract]

07:45.595 --> 07:46.724
Holy shit.

07:55.474 --> 07:56.194
Boss,

07:56.349 --> 07:57.469
the iron parcel has arrived.

07:58.166 --> 07:59.343
This is from Mr. Sau.

08:04.307 --> 08:05.944
Bring the case back to him.

08:06.557 --> 08:07.757
Chinatown is under my control.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.932
Double the batch next time.

08:13.890 --> 08:14.890
Hey.

08:15.557 --> 08:16.932
Take this away as well.

08:17.307 --> 08:19.515
Leaving it here could blow me up.

09:11.278 --> 09:12.278
Put it down here.

10:25.015 --> 10:26.432
I need your place.

10:26.807 --> 10:27.807
Do you have a problem?

10:41.599 --> 10:42.599
Long.

10:44.349 --> 10:45.349
Dung.

10:52.057 --> 10:53.057
What's the matter?

10:55.869 --> 10:57.333
There have been deaths in our area.

11:02.432 --> 11:03.432
What was the reason?

11:03.807 --> 11:04.807
Drugs.

11:04.932 --> 11:05.932
What?

11:12.182 --> 11:13.182
Rules are rules.

11:13.265 --> 11:14.345
Drug dealing is prohibited.

11:15.807 --> 11:17.270
I'm simply making money.

11:18.101 --> 11:19.567
Why must you
make things hard for me?

11:21.150 --> 11:22.533
You're taking
Din's side now, aren't you?

11:22.557 --> 11:23.417
Damn you!

11:23.442 --> 11:24.574
That asshole murdered Hao!

11:27.301 --> 11:28.821
Do you have the courage to oppose him?

11:29.765 --> 11:31.224
We've lost too many people.

11:32.932 --> 11:34.572
I'm unable to
take care of their families.

11:34.890 --> 11:37.974
If everyone disobeys
the rules out of fear for Din,

11:45.443 --> 11:47.980
you are putting
your children and family at risk

11:48.255 --> 11:49.684
and could end up behind bars.

11:50.390 --> 11:51.390
I am in dire need

11:53.140 --> 11:55.557
of everyone's unified strength
for the sake of Chinatown.

11:56.765 --> 11:57.974
If anybody is unwilling,

11:58.474 --> 11:59.682
I won't stand in the way.

12:03.682 --> 12:04.682
Brother.

12:10.390 --> 12:11.390
I address you...

12:11.474 --> 12:12.914
as a brother out of respect for you.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.340
Before taking his last breath,

12:15.974 --> 12:17.574
brother Hao entrusted Chinatown to Long.

12:20.849 --> 12:22.182
If you've got a problem,

12:24.140 --> 12:25.224
then get lost!

12:27.349 --> 12:28.509
I've already made up my mind.

12:29.974 --> 12:31.334
The decision is yours to consider.

12:35.307 --> 12:36.512
What an asshole.

12:45.765 --> 12:46.765
What's the plan, Long?

12:47.057 --> 12:49.083
Nearly ninety percent
of our area has been taken.

12:49.778 --> 12:51.778
Everyone must not act recklessly.

12:52.140 --> 12:52.809
For now,

12:52.834 --> 12:54.994
keep an eye on
where they're transporting the drugs to.

12:55.178 --> 12:57.715
Then I'll get Hung
to deplete their resources.

13:01.936 --> 13:03.616
How then can
we carry on with our business?

13:04.419 --> 13:05.419
I'm listening.

13:07.432 --> 13:11.015
This approach is the only way for the
authorities to handle Din effectively.

13:38.099 --> 13:39.099
Hello?

13:39.491 --> 13:41.533
You should not call me at times like this.

13:42.140 --> 13:43.475
At times like this,

13:43.833 --> 13:45.202
it is most fitting.

13:46.224 --> 13:48.015
Din has cooperated with Sau Mui.

13:48.265 --> 13:48.682
What?

13:48.932 --> 13:51.975
A huge drugs shipment is arriving.

13:52.640 --> 13:55.765
Do not let your juniors ruin everything.

13:56.474 --> 13:57.474
I see.

13:59.202 --> 14:01.608
We started off
saying we'd make cash together.

14:01.947 --> 14:03.061
Yet now,

14:03.099 --> 14:05.890
all of our business
establishments are closed.

14:06.283 --> 14:07.575
No deals going down.

14:11.432 --> 14:12.733
There's nothing we can do.

14:13.849 --> 14:15.474
What did you promise us at first?

14:16.599 --> 14:18.439
You were bursting with confidence,
weren't you?

14:40.421 --> 14:41.421
Put in here.

14:42.507 --> 14:43.549
Sweet dreams, gatekeeper.

14:44.099 --> 14:45.182
Let's go!

14:45.765 --> 14:47.932
Hurry, hurry!

14:48.349 --> 14:49.390
Quick!

14:53.885 --> 14:55.889
Move aside! Move aside!

14:57.099 --> 14:58.557
Let's fill the tank completely.

15:00.099 --> 15:02.057
You dare think sitting here with me

15:04.432 --> 15:06.819
makes you my equal, huh?

15:09.807 --> 15:10.807
I'm...

15:10.932 --> 15:13.514
only doing business for profit.

15:13.682 --> 15:15.491
I don't want any trouble.

15:17.432 --> 15:18.686
About Chinatown,

15:19.390 --> 15:21.349
we will wait
until you have complete control.

15:22.474 --> 15:24.577
When giants quarrel,

15:24.760 --> 15:27.123
the dwarfs like us get squashed.

15:29.073 --> 15:29.657
Boss, come here!

15:29.682 --> 15:30.733
- What?
- Help me! Help me!

15:32.265 --> 15:33.265
To the right.

15:34.265 --> 15:35.608
- Is it done?
- Is it okay, boss?

15:35.740 --> 15:36.949
Taste this.

15:36.974 --> 15:37.998
- Boss! Boss!
- What?

16:03.932 --> 16:05.015
Fuck!

16:06.432 --> 16:07.432
Boss.

16:07.974 --> 16:09.224
Everywhere!

16:10.182 --> 16:11.389
Let them have a big buffet today.

16:11.390 --> 16:13.182
We have plenty of shits.

16:13.474 --> 16:14.807
Have a full meal, suckers.

16:15.890 --> 16:17.224
- Go, go.
- Retreat. Retreat.

16:18.390 --> 16:19.022
Go, go.

16:19.265 --> 16:20.265
Wait a second.

16:23.849 --> 16:24.849
So stinky!

16:28.099 --> 16:29.432
Go find out who did this!

16:29.849 --> 16:30.849
Yes sir!

16:51.682 --> 16:53.182
Yeah! Yeah!

16:56.682 --> 17:00.056
- Yeah yeah!
- Yeah yeah!

17:00.057 --> 17:01.182
Wait, wait, wait.

17:01.432 --> 17:02.557
Let me call Long.

17:04.349 --> 17:05.349
Where my phone?

17:10.765 --> 17:13.245
Mom, drink some milk
after you eat the porridge to feel better.

17:30.358 --> 17:31.498
I'm listening, what's up?

17:31.849 --> 17:32.849
Long.

17:32.974 --> 17:36.099
I've got a really
hilarious story to tell you in a bit.

17:37.265 --> 17:38.265
Talk to you later, okay?

17:38.682 --> 17:40.006
Okay. Okay.

17:42.349 --> 17:45.474
- Yeah, yeah!
- Yeah, yeah!

17:51.807 --> 17:52.991
What kind of driving is that?

17:53.307 --> 17:54.325
You're having too much fun, little kid.

17:54.349 --> 17:54.803
Careful!

17:54.890 --> 17:55.199
Idiot!

17:55.224 --> 17:56.365
Wait, wait, wait.

17:56.390 --> 17:57.405
I need to brag to Hung.

18:02.182 --> 18:02.655
Hello?

18:03.015 --> 18:03.491
Hung!

18:03.765 --> 18:06.515
I've got a really
hilarious story to tell you in a bit.

18:08.307 --> 18:09.475
Oh. Okay.

18:20.349 --> 18:21.640
Was it Phong again?

18:24.619 --> 18:25.619
Yeah.

18:25.849 --> 18:27.249
He called
to ask about mom's health.

18:32.390 --> 18:33.670
Are you hiding anything from me?

18:42.682 --> 18:43.682
Actually…

18:44.390 --> 18:45.640
I'm handling a few matters.

18:46.521 --> 18:48.881
After everything is done,
I will take you and mom back home.

18:50.952 --> 18:51.952
Okay?

18:55.890 --> 18:57.224
You must be careful.

18:59.291 --> 19:01.531
You're the only one I have now.
You know that, don't you?

19:09.724 --> 19:10.724
I know.

19:16.682 --> 19:17.765
I'll come in with mom.

19:18.349 --> 19:19.349
Okay...

19:26.051 --> 19:29.986
I am not strong enough
to continue living like Ut Det.

19:50.648 --> 19:52.123
Bring this back to Mr. Sau.

20:01.807 --> 20:03.847
Remember to collect
all the goods for me next month.

20:25.140 --> 20:26.380
How is the task I assigned you?

20:27.150 --> 20:28.150
It's done.

20:34.807 --> 20:35.807
Bastards.

20:37.161 --> 20:38.944
Are you up for playing foul?

20:53.474 --> 20:54.639
What are you doing, Long?

20:55.807 --> 20:57.167
You have a family to take care of.

20:58.515 --> 20:59.515
Think of your mother,

21:00.474 --> 21:01.474
your wife.

21:02.349 --> 21:03.589
Remove yourself from this mess.

21:07.257 --> 21:09.037
We didn't do it on purpose.

21:09.349 --> 21:11.569
We simply thought
we could help you achieve something

21:12.474 --> 21:13.724
to solve the case. That's all.

21:16.294 --> 21:17.894
What do you know
about police procedures?

21:18.307 --> 21:20.928
Such actions
only stir up the wasp's nest.

21:21.842 --> 21:23.442
When will we ever discover their source?

21:24.349 --> 21:26.084
When will Chinatown
finally achieve peace?

21:27.224 --> 21:28.224
Hey!

21:29.334 --> 21:30.334
Dumbass.

21:31.140 --> 21:32.640
My hands are full of shits.

21:32.807 --> 21:33.557
Hey.

21:33.744 --> 21:36.092
My heads are full of shits.

21:36.349 --> 21:36.699
Hey,

21:36.724 --> 21:38.569
I wish you guys
could witness that scene.

21:38.807 --> 21:39.807
Damn.

21:39.932 --> 21:41.932
This time I made them eat shit literally.

21:42.557 --> 21:43.740
Not just a piece.

21:43.849 --> 21:44.932
A whole tank.

21:45.140 --> 21:46.380
Too bad you guys weren't there.

21:46.515 --> 21:49.015
It would've been
even more fun if you were there.

21:50.974 --> 21:52.592
Are you using me
to take revenge on Din?

21:52.682 --> 21:53.682
What?

21:53.867 --> 21:54.909
Am I your henchman?

21:55.076 --> 21:56.357
Nobody thinks of you like that.

22:00.140 --> 22:01.825
It was just
killing two birds with one stone.

22:01.849 --> 22:03.224
Relax.

22:03.724 --> 22:04.724
Why are you so tense?

22:05.432 --> 22:06.522
How silly!

22:06.728 --> 22:07.728
Listen to me.

22:08.932 --> 22:10.640
You have to use your imagination.

22:11.015 --> 22:11.990
I'm standing here...

22:12.015 --> 22:13.695
and I can still smell the shit over there.

22:13.974 --> 22:14.449
Cheers!

22:14.474 --> 22:16.515
I don't want to hear
any more of your shitty story.

22:20.390 --> 22:21.390
So…

22:22.057 --> 22:24.099
What about
stories involving drugs?

22:25.015 --> 22:27.057
Do you want to hear?

22:27.890 --> 22:29.307
I do know something.

22:30.432 --> 22:32.186
I assume
it might be important to you.

22:35.640 --> 22:36.640
Do you want to know?

22:37.307 --> 22:38.307
Hear him out.

22:38.515 --> 22:39.515
You won't regret it.

22:42.369 --> 22:44.009
A huge drugs shipment is going to arrive…

22:44.349 --> 22:46.139
Do you really believe what they said?

22:46.474 --> 22:47.474
Yes.

22:47.737 --> 22:50.697
They might not think things over,
but they've never been dishonest with me.

22:51.640 --> 22:52.532
Don't you think...

22:52.557 --> 22:54.015
they're taking advantage of you,

22:54.040 --> 22:55.740
using you to eradicate one another?

22:56.682 --> 22:57.765
Look at yourself.

22:58.640 --> 23:00.200
Have you spent
so much time as a gangster

23:00.224 --> 23:01.592
that you've forgotten who you are?

23:02.432 --> 23:03.682
Take some time off for now.

23:03.890 --> 23:04.307
Dad!

23:04.515 --> 23:06.241
I cannot withdraw
from the investigation at this time.

23:06.265 --> 23:07.265
Comrade Hung!

23:07.890 --> 23:10.365
We can't kick off a mission
over a single sentence.

23:10.390 --> 23:11.920
They've never been dishonest with you.

23:12.057 --> 23:13.015
I understand, but…

23:13.057 --> 23:15.576
I'm only saying
you should rest for a while.

23:16.307 --> 23:18.667
Or do you want to be
eliminated from the investigation team?

23:23.682 --> 23:24.682
Roger that!

23:26.099 --> 23:27.499
Damn, the truck is cramped already.

23:27.890 --> 23:28.990
Whose stinky fart is that?

23:29.015 --> 23:29.842
Mine.

23:29.890 --> 23:30.490
Boss?

23:30.849 --> 23:31.890
Dumbass! Dumbass!

23:32.640 --> 23:33.490
Boss.

23:33.515 --> 23:34.600
- What?
- I have an idea.

23:35.015 --> 23:36.975
Could you change to
a more spacious truck someday?

23:37.099 --> 23:38.975
This one is too cramped,
I can barely breath.

23:39.349 --> 23:42.256
Only if you
cleaned all the shit of this city.

23:42.319 --> 23:43.186
Focus on your job.

23:43.307 --> 23:45.200
Could it be that
I have to do this until old age?

23:45.224 --> 23:46.412
What a bright future.

23:46.974 --> 23:47.974
Do you know Ding Lik?

23:48.474 --> 23:49.474
Who is that?

23:49.818 --> 23:50.818
He cleaned shit...

23:51.015 --> 23:52.681
and became the boss
of the Bund of Shanghai.

23:52.682 --> 23:53.224
Amazing, huh?

23:53.474 --> 23:54.282
How cool!

23:54.307 --> 23:55.307
Of course.

23:55.390 --> 23:56.390
Be optimistic.

23:57.474 --> 23:59.682
Be optimistic! Be optimistic!

23:59.765 --> 24:00.390
Be optimistic!

24:00.390 --> 24:00.807
Be bright!

24:00.890 --> 24:02.639
Optimistic! Optimistic!

24:02.640 --> 24:05.515
Go, go, go!

24:11.111 --> 24:12.351
Who took the deal this morning?

24:12.807 --> 24:13.807
It was me.

24:14.093 --> 24:15.288
I cannot contact them.

24:16.682 --> 24:18.561
Have you checked the location carefully?

24:19.557 --> 24:20.182
It's him.

24:20.349 --> 24:22.057
He gave directions this morning.

24:22.765 --> 24:24.015
Screw you!

24:37.224 --> 24:37.807
Brother Long!

24:37.932 --> 24:39.765
Run!

24:41.515 --> 24:42.515
This way, brother Long!

24:45.140 --> 24:47.060
Even a cleaning service
got canceled last minute.

24:47.931 --> 24:49.007
Look, boss.

24:49.432 --> 24:51.182
It's a truck that looks like ours.

24:55.765 --> 24:56.265
I see.

24:56.557 --> 24:58.200
They definitely
got canceled last minute just like us.

24:58.224 --> 24:59.474
Hey,

24:59.599 --> 25:00.599
fellow workmate.

25:00.765 --> 25:01.765
Got canceled last minute?

